<title>UK: Vanguard Medica up on sucessful anti-migraine drug.</title>
<headline>Vanguard Medica up on sucessful anti-migraine drug.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Vanguard Medica PLC gained on Monday after the UK drug company said trial results showed its new migraine remedy would be effective.</p>
<p>By 0930 GMT the stocks was up 22-1/2p to 580p.</p>
<p>Vanguard had earlier announced that the full results from its Phase IIB trial of VML 251 showed that the anti-migraine drug had a very low rate of recurrence of headaches.</p>
<p>Vanguard is developing VML 251 in cooperation with SmithKline Beecham Plc.</p>
</text>
